{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-q-resolvent-exists","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Proposition","doco:Section"],"label":"prop:q-resolvent-exists","kind":"proposition","title":"Existence of the $q$-resolvent","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-q-resolvent","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-categorical-laplace-exists"],"proofs":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prf-q-resolvent-exists"],"tags":["existence","resolvent"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.QResolvent.exists","text":"q-resolvent-exists.md","leanSource":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/q-resolvent-exists.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"prop:q-resolvent-exists\"></a><p>For <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">s \\in \\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathbf{C}}(\\mathbf{1}, A)</code> outside the categorical spectrum of <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\widehat{\\Delta_q}</code>, the <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q</code>-resolvent <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">R_q(s) = (s + \\widehat{\\Delta_q})^{-1}</code> exists as an endomorphism of <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathrm{End}_{\\mathbf{C}}(A)</code>.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/q-resolvent-exists.md","leanStatus":"proved","heading":"Proposition","number":"3.21.3"}
